schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-map-plane-of-echoes
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Top-down dungeon map of the Plane of Echoes — Zone 7 of Echo of Manifestation, a survival horror
    roguelite. Dark fantasy game design document style, bird's-eye architectural floor plan.

    This is the most visually complex map — a MIRRORED REALITY where the layout is an inverted,
    corrupted reflection of the previous zones. The map should have a mirror-symmetry quality where
    rooms on one side have distorted echoes on the other:

    ENTRY (north): Mirror passage from Zone 6's threshold corridor. The entrance itself is a mirror
    frame — stepping through reverses orientation. A resonance shrine that appears as its own reflection.

    MIRROR GALLERY — COMBAT (center): 18m x 16m hall of cracked mirrors. Mirror positions drawn as
    reflective line segments at various angles. ECHO CLONES shown as ghosted duplicates of room
    elements offset by 2-second delay indicators. Some mirrors are PORTALS TO ECHO-SPACE shown as
    mirror-frame passages with an inverted-color interior. Two essence nodes in echo-space (visible
    through mirrors, must enter mirror to collect). Four shadow nodes: inside mirrors, as echo clones
    of shadow nodes from previous rooms. MIRROR SHATTER hazard zones with glass shard indicators.
    CONTROLS INVERT markers near mirror surfaces showing reversed movement indicators.

    MEMORY LATTICE — PUZZLE (west): 14m x 14m. Floating memory fragments forming a 3D lattice drawn
    as floating rectangular screens at various heights (height indicated by opacity — higher = more
    transparent). Each fragment shows a mini-icon of a previous zone's room. Arrangement targets shown
    as ghost outlines. One essence node attached to the correct final fragment. Three shadow nodes
    disguised as memory fragments. MEMORY CASCADE hazard shown with damage replay indicators.

    ECHO HOARD — LOOT (east): 16m x 12m treasure room. Loot items drawn in dual state: SOLID (real,
    collectible) and GHOSTED (echo, intangible). Phase timing indicators showing 4-12 second cycles.
    Three essence nodes in phase with real state on different timers. Two shadow nodes trapped in echo
    items. PHASE MISMATCH hazard near items with resonance backlash warning. A TIME DILATION POCKET
    always in real state behind a phased wall that shifts every 8 seconds (shown as alternating
    solid/ghost wall segments).

    THE FIRST REFLECTION — SECRET (accessible through a specific mirror in Mirror Gallery): 12m x 12m
    drawn with dashed border. A REVERSED COPY of the very first room the player entered — layout
    mirrored left-to-right with everything reversed and saturated with resonance glow. A PLAYER ECHO
    at center performing the player's first actions (shown as a ghosted figure). Two essence nodes:
    held by the player echo, embedded in reversed architecture. Three shadow nodes: player echo spawns
    copies if disturbed, hidden in reversed furniture. ONTOLOGICAL PARADOX hazard shown as a proximity
    danger zone around the player echo with increasing damage rings.

    THE GRAND RESONANCE — BOSS (south): 24m x 24m infinite-feeling chamber. Every action creates
    persistent echoes — shown as layered ghost images of combat positions across the arena. Past
    boss attacks replay as ghost indicators. The floor reflects an impossible sky shown as a sky-
    pattern layer beneath a transparent floor. Reality layers stacked visibly drawn as offset
    translucent room copies at slight angles. Four essence nodes at stability anchors in each corner.
    Seven shadow nodes layered across reality echoes — each representing a previous zone boss shadow
    with zone-specific icons. ECHO DECAY mechanic shown as an echo counter (after 30 echoes,
    independent attack indicators). A TIME DILATION POCKET at north stability anchor during phase 2.
    Boss marker: "HEART'S MEMORY" with a beautiful-but-wrong-heart icon. The Zone replays previous
    survivors' deaths shown as ghost death markers scattered across the arena.

    The mirrored reality mechanic is shown throughout — the map has an axis of symmetry running
    vertically through the center. Rooms on one side have distorted mirror versions on the other.
    Light comes from shadows and darkness from light sources — lighting indicators are inverted
    compared to previous zone maps (shadow pools are bright, lit areas are dark).

    Map legend: Amber diamond = Essence Node, Purple circle = Shadow Node, Golden bubble = Time
    Dilation Pocket, Dashed border = Secret Room, Skull icon = Boss, Mirror frame = Echo Portal,
    Ghost figure = Echo Clone, Counter = Echo Decay Tracker.

    Style: Architectural blueprint on inverted-color background (light where previous maps were dark,
    dark where they were light). Room walls drawn with colors that are the photographic negative of
    previous zone palettes. Mirror surfaces render as reflective silver lines. Echo elements shown
    as translucent overlays with slight offset. The entire map should feel like looking at a
    reflection of a reflection. Professional game design document aesthetic with disorienting beauty.
  negative: "bright colors, cartoon, anime, 3D rendered, photorealistic, normal architecture, standard lighting, cheerful, symmetrical perfection, clean mirror, low detail"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

tags: [map, zone-7, plane-of-echoes, top-down, dungeon-map, game-design-document, dark-fantasy, mirrored]
